  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "S’mores & Stars! Free Seasonal Bonfires Included with your booking! Join us for complimentary fires: June 1–Aug 7, Sept 18–Oct 16, and Holiday weeks November & Dec. <br>Juan Fine Day | Luxury Multi-Family Beach Retreat with Private Heated Pool & Golf Cart<br>Welcome to Juan Fine Day — an epic coastal escape designed for unforgettable 30A vacations.<br>Perfectly curated for luxury seekers, multi-family gatherings, and vacation heaven moments, this stunning multi-level beach home offers the space, amenities, and location guests crave when vacationing along Scenic Highway 30A.<br><br>Flooded with natural light and thoughtfully designed for connection and comfort, Juan Fine Day features two full kitchens, two living rooms, and expansive indoor and outdoor living areas, making it ideal for large groups who want to vacation together without feeling crowded. From poolside lounging to shuffleboard tournaments and effortless beach days via golf cart, every moment here feels elevated and easy.<br><br>Nestled just north of 30A in the heart of Seagrove Beach, guests are perfectly positioned to enjoy the area’s pristine beaches, charming coastal towns, and top-tier dining — all within a short bike ride or golf cart cruise.<br><br>Beach Access<br>Guests enjoy convenient access to some of the most desirable beach entry points on 30A:<br><br>Private deeded beach access: San Juan, Pelayo, and Barcelona Streets — located directly south of the home across 30A<br><br>Nearest public beach access: Santa Clara, offering parking, restrooms, lifeguards, and ADA accessibility<br><br>Accommodations | Sleeps Large Groups Comfortably<br>Designed for privacy, comfort, and flexibility, the home features six beautifully appointed bedrooms:<br><br>First Floor<br><br>Bedroom 1: King bed with ensuite bathroom<br><br>Bedroom 2: King bed with ensuite bathroom<br><br>Bedroom 3: King bed with shared bathroom<br><br>Second Floor<br><br>Bedroom 4: King bed with ensuite bathroom<br><br>Bedroom 5: King bed with ensuite bathroom<br><br>Bedroom 6: Two Full/Full bunk beds with shared bathroom<br><br>Property Highlights & Amenities<br>Private pool (heating available upon request for an additional fee)<br><br>6-seater golf cart<br><br>4 adult bikes<br><br>Two full kitchens<br><br>Two spacious living rooms<br><br>Shuffleboard table<br><br>Washer & dryer on both first and second floors<br><br>Gas grill<br><br>Fully stocked kitchen<br><br>Full linen package including bedding and towels<br><br>Self check-in for seamless arrival<br><br>Parking<br>Up to 6 parking spaces, depending on vehicle size<br><br>House Rules & Important Information<br>Check-in: After 4:00 PM | Check-out: 10:00 AM<br><br>No smoking or vaping<br><br>Renters must be 25 years of age or older<br><br>Private elevator use restricted to guests 18+ unless accompanied by an adult<br><br>Elevator resets due to misuse will incur a $250 service charge<br><br>During peak times, internet connectivity may be impacted due to limited infrastructure<br><br>No refunds provided for slow or unavailable WiFi<br><br>All rentals subject to state and county taxes and additional required fees<br><br>Bikes and golf carts are not guaranteed to be on-site or in working order<br><br>No refunds provided for missing or inoperable equipment<br><br>Why Book with Bonheur?<br>Bonheur believes luxury is more than just a beautiful home — it’s the experience. From pristine preparation and seamless self check-in to attentive, responsive guest care, Bonheur delivers hospitality with heart. When you book with Bonheur, you’re choosing peace of mind, thoughtful service, and a team dedicated to making your vacation effortless, elevated, and unforgettable.<br><br>Juan Fine Day isn’t just a place to stay — it’s your vacation heaven on 30A.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
